  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hR5Fak2.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@nightbeamstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iEfuOn8.png\" width=\"647\" height=\"340\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>RE: 構建法杖 (RE:Constructed Wands)</strong>&nbsp;是 Minecraft 的终极建築實用工具，旨在讓大規模建設變得簡單、高效且令人滿意。這是一款經典建築法杖的現代重製版，已針對最新版本的 Minecraft（Fabric &amp; NeoForge）進行了全面優化。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fnightbeamstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/670f5a0171bfb928b21a7e00_support_me_on_kofi_beige.png\" alt=\"品牌資產\" width=\"318\" height=\"64\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vi45Fvc.png\" width=\"656\" height=\"241\"></p>\n<h2><strong>📜 <span style=\"color:#fff\">製作人員</span></strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ThetaDev</strong>：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/thetadev/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原作者</a></span>，<span style=\"color:#3598db\">來自 <a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/construction-wand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Construction Wand</a></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>NAIZO</strong>：移植、維護以及更新。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></em></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\"></span></span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></em></span></strong></span></p>\n<h3><strong>強大的法杖</strong></h3>\n<p>從多種法杖中選擇，每種法杖都有獨特的耐久度和區塊放置限制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>石製法杖 (Stone Wand)</strong>：適合遊戲前期，最多可放置 9 個區塊。</li>\n<li><strong>鐵製法杖 (Iron Wand)</strong>：堅固的升級版，最多可放置 27 個區塊。</li>\n<li><strong>鑽石法杖 (Diamond Wand)</strong>：為嚴肅的建造者設計，最多可放置 128 個區塊。</li>\n<li><strong>獄髓法杖 (Netherite Wand)</strong>：高耐久度，最多可放置 512 個區塊。</li>\n<li><strong>無限法杖 (Infinity Wand)</strong>：僅限創造模式，沒有任何限制！</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>升級核心 (Upgrade Cores)</strong></h3>\n<p>透過專用核心自訂您的建築體驗：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>建築核心 (Construction Core - 預設)</strong>：在您面向的方向延伸區塊。</li>\n<li><strong>天使核心 (Angel Core)</strong>：在空中放置區塊，或在區塊的另一側放置！非常適合建造天橋和困難位置的放置。</li>\n<li><strong>破壞核心 (Destruction Core)</strong>：快速移除區塊以撤銷錯誤或清理區域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>進階控制</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>方向鎖定 (Direction Lock)</strong>：將放置鎖定為水平、垂直、南北軸或東西軸。</li>\n<li><strong>撤銷功能 (Undo Functionality)</strong>：出錯了？立即撤銷您上一次的法杖放置操作。</li>\n<li><strong>網格吸附 (Grid Snapping)</strong>：（可選）保持您的建築完美對齊。</li>\n<li><strong>流體邏輯 (Fluid Logic)</strong>：智能放置，尊重半磚、樓梯和原木的狀態。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lZESFPo.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DpAbaeK.png\"></p>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\"></a></p>\n</div>",
